1
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:08,400
How could I kill my father?

2
00:01:10,879 --> 00:01:11,920
Zhang Tianyou!

3
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,480
Tell me!

4
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:16,400
I didn't kill my father, did I?

5
00:01:16,799 --> 00:01:18,159
You're lying to me.

6
00:01:18,159 --> 00:01:19,400
Zhang Tianyou!

7
00:01:22,879 --> 00:01:24,680
So what if I killed him?

8
00:01:25,079 --> 00:01:27,480
Power and strength are everything!

9
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,359
Lord Evil God!

10
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,239
Give me your power!

11
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:33,840
Let me be Destined by Fate!

12
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:54,319
Human greed is indeed scarier than evil creatures.

13
00:02:00,959 --> 00:02:03,920
You're about to die and you still dare to mess with me?

14
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:04,799
What?

15
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:07,280
Are you trying to kill me with that hand?

16
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,800
Zhang Tianyou, you're done for.

17
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,199
Go to hell!

18
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,759
Lord Evil God!

19
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:36,840
Leave my body intact!

20
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:42,039
Lord Evil God, wait for me!

21
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,199
Zhang Tianyou!

22
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,400
Are you okay?

23
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,520
Brother!

24
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:02,400
Chief, as you ordered,

25
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,159
the men are waiting outside.

26
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:05,439
Xiaoshuai, Xiaomei,

27
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:08,039
have the men take Miss Sheng

28
00:03:08,599 --> 00:03:10,439
and Master Wan back.

29
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:11,400
Yes.

30
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:22,199
Be careful, everyone.

31
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:32,120
Chief Leng,

32
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,240
thank you.

33
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:40,759
This place hides many ancient viruses.

34
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:45,759
Let's use explosives to blow it all up.

35
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,159
All this time,

36
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:51,360
I thought you'd use magic to cleanse the tomb.

37
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:55,319
Who knew you'd just blow it up in the end.

38
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,400
Let's go.

39
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,199
Blow it up.

40
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:14,199
Yes.

41
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:37,399
I knew it.

42
00:04:37,399 --> 00:04:40,120
What I saw just now was all real.

43
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:44,959
So the treasure is all here.

44
00:04:50,399 --> 00:04:54,959
This treasure brings power and strength.

45
00:04:59,639 --> 00:05:01,160
Zhang Tianyou,

46
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:03,319
that Day of Reckoning on the full moon...

47
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:05,160
what was it really about?

48
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:12,519
The events 20 years ago happened on a full moon.

49
00:05:13,079 --> 00:05:14,560
The so-called Day of Reckoning

50
00:05:14,879 --> 00:05:16,959
was actually first spread by me.

51
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:21,439
Just to push you to join me down here sooner.

52
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,680
Twenty years ago,

53
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:30,959
what The Four Great Families did to your people...

54
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,319
But

55
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:34,800
none of it can be undone.

56
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:35,839
Dad.

57
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,480
This whole tomb raiding business

58
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:42,399
is merely driven by greed and obsession,

59
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,120
willingly crossing between life and death.

60
00:05:44,879 --> 00:05:46,480
Back then, my people,

61
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:48,480
if not for their greed for the treasure in this tomb,

62
00:05:49,079 --> 00:05:51,439
wouldn't have led The Four Great Families here.

63
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,959
Right and wrong

64
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,639
are buried with a shovel of yellow earth,

65
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,959
sealed away here forever.

66
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,160
It's gonna blow! Hurry!

67
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,040
It's all mine.

68
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,160
An illusion.

69
00:06:22,879 --> 00:06:24,120
It must be an illusion.

70
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:26,079
Don't try to scare me.

71
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,120
Mine.

72
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,720
It's all mine.

73
00:06:54,639 --> 00:06:55,680
All of this...

74
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:58,319
was due to ancient rotting wood and damp mud

75
00:06:58,319 --> 00:07:00,439
releasing some unknown pathogen.

76
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:01,480
And then,

77
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,399
it distorted their vision and hearing,

78
00:07:03,399 --> 00:07:05,000
and affected the central nervous system.

79
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,639
You mean the hallucinations they saw,

80
00:07:08,639 --> 00:07:10,560
and The Four Great Families' dream murders,

81
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,600
were all because of this?

82
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:13,120
Exactly.

83
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:14,319
Then...

84
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:16,319
They're here.

85
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,560
Now that the Wan, Mei, Qi, and Sheng families

86
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,800
and the Sand-Turning Gang are now one,

87
00:07:30,839 --> 00:07:31,680
Zhang Tianyou,

88
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,360
you, our Dragon-Seeking Champion,

89
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,600
are going to have your hands full.

90
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,439
Brother Mouse,

91
00:07:39,439 --> 00:07:40,720
I suddenly really miss

92
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:43,199
our good old days as Diggers.

93
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:45,360
I don't want to be a Digger again.

94
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:46,959
Your top priority right now

95
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:49,560
is to hurry and find a wife to help you.

96
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,439
Did you guys just hear that?

97
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:53,519
I thought the so-called evil creature back then

98
00:08:53,639 --> 00:08:55,840
was really just a strange genetic disease.

99
00:08:56,519 --> 00:08:58,120
But later on...

100
00:08:58,519 --> 00:08:59,600
Old Zhang,

101
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,600
you were a storyteller before the Liberation, right?

102
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,039
What evil creatures...

103
00:09:03,039 --> 00:09:04,159
and strange diseases...

104
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,600
Just keep making things up.

105
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,480
So many things,

106
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,960
true or false,

107
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,320
whether you believe them or not,

108
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:13,320
are like opening or closing the door to your heart.

109
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,879
If there were really evil creatures,

110
00:09:15,879 --> 00:09:19,159
wouldn't an anti-aircraft gun blow them to pieces?

111
00:09:21,639 --> 00:09:24,159
An anti-aircraft gun can destroy evil creatures,

112
00:09:24,759 --> 00:09:28,159
but it can't destroy greed, obsession, and lust.

113
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:30,360
My young friends,

114
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:33,159
times have changed now.

115
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,879
Any strange disease can be cured.

116
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:37,120
But since ancient times,

117
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:42,080
only conscience can restrain greed and obsession.

118
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,200
Old Zhang,

119
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,720
you should just go write a novel.

120
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,600
Your story isn't mysterious enough.

121
00:09:46,679 --> 00:09:48,519
You need to make it more exciting.

122
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:49,879
By the way,

123
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,919
why do I remember your name is Zhang Shouling?

124
00:09:52,919 --> 00:09:53,879
I'm getting old.

125
00:09:53,879 --> 00:09:55,720
I can't even remember my own name.

126
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,000
Alright.

127
00:09:59,000 --> 00:09:59,480
We're leaving.

128
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,159
Let's go, let's go.

129
00:10:00,159 --> 00:10:01,159
Let's go, let's go.

130
00:10:01,159 --> 00:10:02,720
Heading home, heading home.

131
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:03,960
This Old Zhang.

132
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:11,960
Tianyou, Shouling.

133
00:10:14,399 --> 00:10:15,840
I can't remember clearly.

134
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,080
I only remember...

135
00:10:18,679 --> 00:10:26,000
Where wind hides and qi gathers, there lie the tombs of emperors and kings.

136
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:34,279
One shovel opens the boundary of yin and yang; success and failure all lie within the yellow earth.
